                        <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Testing windows, in-scope assets, source addresses, access methods, and potentially disruptive actions are coordinated with your team before execution.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <ol class="space-y-4">
            <li class="trust-card-no-hover flex gap-5">
                <span class="font-label text-label-md text-primary">01</span>
                <div><h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-2"><span class="text-primary">Scope and Plan</span></h3><p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Define assets, access, exclusions, testing windows, communication channels, and success criteria.</p></div>
            </li>
            <li class="trust-card-no-hover flex gap-5">
                <span class="font-label text-label-md text-primary">02</span>
                <div><h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-2"><span class="text-primary">Discover and Test</span></h3><p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Combine broad attack-surface discovery with targeted testing of applications, networks, identities, and integrations.</p></div>
            </li>
            <li class="trust-card-no-hover flex gap-5">
                <span class="font-label text-label-md text-primary">03</span>
                <div><h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-2"><span class="text-primary">Validate and Prioritize</span></h3><p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Manually verify exploitable findings, preserve reproducible evidence, and rank risk by likelihood and business impact.</p></div>
            </li>
            <li class="trust-card-no-hover flex gap-5">
                <span class="font-label text-label-md text-primary">04</span>
                <div><h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-2"><span class="text-primary">Report and Remediate</span></h3><p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Deliver an executive summary, technical evidence, practical remediation guidance, and a clear path to retesting.</p></div>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-gutter mt-8">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low p-6 md:p-8">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_2fr] gap-6 lg:gap-10 items-center">
                <div>
                    <p class="font-label text-label-sm text-accent mb-3 uppercase tracking-widest">Proven in a Live Payment Environment</p>
                    <h3 class="font-headline text-2xl md:text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-3"><span class="text-primary">Speed That Shortens Exposure</span></h3>
                    <p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">For a regulated fintech, our team found a critical authorization flaw within two hours. The customer patched it and Tabiri verified the fix that same day.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                    <div class="border-l-2 border-primary pl-4"><p class="font-headline text-3xl text-primary mb-1">100%</p><p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">of in-scope internal TCP ports assessed</p></div>
                    <div class="border-l-2 border-primary pl-4"><p class="font-headline text-3xl text-primary mb-1">24 hours</p><p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">to a prioritized resilience roadmap</p></div>
                    <div class="border-l-2 border-primary pl-4"><p class="font-headline text-3xl text-primary mb-1">Up to 14x</p><p class="font-body text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">faster than the comparable manual process</p></div>
